VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'point and form what\'s known as the optic nerve. And so because there\'s a kind of a hole inside the retina, this forms a blind spot. Octopuses and squid don\'t have any blind spots. Our eyes also differ in the way they seem to focus and'

